## Development

Run the project-owned scripts used by `givn/commands.yaml`:

```sh
./run-tests.sh
./run-tests.sh --e2e
./measure-coverage.sh
./merge-coverages.sh
```

`measure-coverage.sh` writes the non-E2E and E2E Cobertura reports.
`merge-coverages.sh` combines them into `coverage/cobertura-coverage.xml`, the
report linked by the badges above. Add lint, build, and other project commands
alongside these scripts.

